CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvdefault DEFINITION PUBLIC FINAL CREATE PUBLIC.
 PUBLIC SECTION.
 CONSTANTS c TYPE i VALUE 7.
 TYPES: BEGIN OF ty_row, n TYPE i, END OF ty_row.
 CONSTANTS: BEGIN OF def, n TYPE i VALUE 9, END OF def.
 CLASS-METHODS qualified IMPORTING p TYPE i DEFAULT zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvdefault=>c RETURNING VALUE(r) TYPE i.
 CLASS-METHODS composite IMPORTING p TYPE ty_row DEFAULT def RETURNING VALUE(r) TYPE i.
 CLASS-METHODS run RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE string.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvdefault IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD qualified. r = p. ENDMETHOD.
 METHOD composite. r = p-n. ENDMETHOD.
 METHOD run. DATA n TYPE i.
 CALL METHOD ('ZCL_GOGEN_T_DYNRECVDEFAULT')=>('QUALIFIED') RECEIVING r = n. rv = |{ n }|.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
